1
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:42,590
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,730
[Episode 21: Let's Get Married]

3
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,000
Does it hurt?

4
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,280
It hurts.

5
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:11,960
Chang Yongbin kicked me
in the waist several times today.

6
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:12,640
And then there's this...

7
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,400
My shoulder and my back.

8
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:16,840
I'm practically falling apart.

9
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,680
It hurts?

10
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:21,640
Yes.

11
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,440
Then why pretend it didn't hurt?

12
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,500
It really hurts.

13
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,960
Good. Now you know how it feels.

14
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:29,760
When they tied you up,

15
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,520
why didn't you think about the pain then?

16
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:31,980
Why didn't you fight back?

17
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,120
You had to wait for me to come rescue you.

18
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,880
You were pretty clever, though.

19
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,479
You even knew to go to Hong.

20
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,880
But Hong already knew you were back.

21
00:01:41,479 --> 00:01:42,400
I was the one who kept her

22
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,330
from seeing you.

23
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,080
Aren't you worried she'll come after you

24
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,759
when she wants to see the child someday?

25
00:01:47,759 --> 00:01:49,440
She's Nannan's grandmother.

26
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:50,900
Why shouldn't she see him?

27
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,759
You've certainly got
a bigger heart than me.

28
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:56,320
Anyway,

29
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,460
Ms. Wan won't dare make a move now,

30
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:00,120
and Hong has completely backed down.

31
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,920
So that's killing two birds
with one stone, right?

32
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,240
Your little act of getting yourself hurt

33
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:07,900
did more than just
kill two birds with one stone.

34
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,259
What else did it do?

35
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,329
Made you worry about me?

36
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,600
Don't ever do that again.

37
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,520
You hear me?

38
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,800
Got it.

39
00:02:31,050 --> 00:02:32,450
You saved my life.

40
00:02:32,470 --> 00:02:34,070
Of course I'll listen to you.

41
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,320
Sorry.

42
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,079
It hurts! It hurts!

43
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,460
Let's get married.

44
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,120
I'd love to.

45
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,370
Then I'll move in tomorrow.

46
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,560
Ladies and gentlemen,

47
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,680
what you're looking at now

48
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,650
[Dongmen Tower]

49
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,480
is Shencheng's newest landmark,

50
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,160
Dongmen.

51
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:06,520
Who would've thought that just a year ago,

52
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,360
this was nothing but a rundown old street?

53
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,200
Today, it's become
a major hub for garment sourcing

54
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,360
across China,

55
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,080
and even Southeast Asia,

56
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,970
becoming a new symbol
of the city's development.

57
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:17,920
Ms. Xie,

58
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,880
as the founder of Dongmen Trade Center,

59
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,800
you not only turned things around
amid the financial crisis,

60
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,760
but also transformed this place
into a city landmark.

61
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:28,000
Could you share your insights with us?

62
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,160
My original vision

63
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:34,620
was to ride the wave
of reform and opening-up

64
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:38,440
and provide a platform for more
entrepreneurs and business owners.

65
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:40,079
Dongmen's success today

66
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:42,079
isn't the result of my efforts alone.

67
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,540
It's a gift from the times,

68
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,800
and the result of the hard work

69
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,960
of every single merchant here.

70
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,800
To me,

71
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,880
it's more than just a trade market.

72
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,360
It's a reflection of Shencheng's
daring, enterprising spirit

73
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:58,090
and its determination
to stay ahead of the curve.

74
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,680
The rise of Dongmen

75
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,800
has witnessed Shencheng's
rapid development

76
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,440
and showcases the vision
and sense of responsibility

77
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:07,300
of entrepreneurs in this new era.

78
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:40,320
[Dongmen Trade]

79
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,370
Do I look beautiful?

80
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,480
Yeah.

81
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,720
Say more.

82
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,800
Beautiful.

83
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:23,280
You're making me feel a little insecure
with how beautiful you look.

84
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Looks like

85
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,160
I really should get myself a proper suit

86
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,640
to be worthy of your gorgeous dress.

87
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,900
Perfect timing, then.

88
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,610
Let's take your measurements.

89
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,120
Right now?

90
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,010
If we're doing it now...

91
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,200
How do we do that?

92
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,820
Take all your clothes off.

93
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,660
Shoulder width, 48 centimeters.

94
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,080
Waist, 80...

95
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,090
How much longer will this take?

96
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,520
Almost done.

97
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:32,210
Are you that eager
to have your qipao made?

98
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,290
How did you know?

99
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:41,880
Sit.

100
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,130
Sit down.

101
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:49,000
I'm planning to launch
a separate product line

102
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:51,400
dedicated to modernized qipaos.

103
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,880
Modernized qipaos?

104
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,640
A lot of overseas brands have come to us,

105
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,440
but we've only ever done
contract manufacturing for them.

106
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:59,370
So all we make is money the hard way.

107
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,040
But the qipao

108
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,200
showcases the beauty of Eastern women.

109
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,680
The problem is, the traditional qipao

110
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,400
is far too restrictive.

111
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:09,240
It's tight-fitting
and difficult to move around in.

112
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,320
Those are all outdated beauty standards.

113
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,200
So,

114
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,040
I want to create

115
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,440
a modernized qipao

116
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:18,080
that is more comfortable,

117
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,280
more practical for everyday wear,

118
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,740
and better suited
to modern women's tastes.

119
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,880
You mean these qipaos
in the files on the table?

120
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,880
Yes, these are the ones.

121
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:32,320
I've spent a long time
developing even these prototypes.

122
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,600
From the lowered collars

123
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,860
to the higher slits and looser armholes,

124
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,520
I want our qipaos

125
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:42,560
to be more than dresses
worn once to formal events.

126
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:46,100
I want them to truly become
part of women's everyday lives.

127
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,159
Women should be able
to wear them shopping,

128
00:07:48,159 --> 00:07:49,120
to work,

129
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,560
or on dates.

130
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,930
They should truly fit into everyday life.

131
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,400
Now that you have an idea,

132
00:07:57,600 --> 00:08:00,360
we should give it a try
as soon as possible.

133
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,400
You're that supportive?

134
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,120
Of course.

135
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,860
Whenever I see that look in your eyes,

136
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,480
whatever you set your mind to,
you make it happen.

137
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,320
That's right.

138
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:14,600
Next, I'll make a few prototypes

139
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,650
and start with a small collection
to test the waters.

140
00:08:17,740 --> 00:08:18,900
After all, qipao craftsmanship

141
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:20,240
is far more complicated

142
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:22,280
than ordinary ready-to-wear.

143
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,920
Especially the embroidery.

144
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:27,520
We'll need some veteran artisans, too.

145
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:34,200
I know quite a few
old tailors in Shencheng.

146
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,760
Tomorrow, I'll have Biao go to Dongmen

147
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:39,320
and find some older seamstresses
who have made qipaos before.

148
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,650
We'll bring them all in.

149
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:52,440
I'm lucky I met you in this life.

150
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:54,680
Ms. Xie,

151
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:57,000
the first batch
of 50 pieces is all finished.

152
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:00,600
They've all passed the craftsmanship
and quality inspections.

153
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,760
It really does take veteran artisans.

154
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,720
Their craftsmanship is incredible.

155
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,250
How's the market response?

156
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,200
Not great.

157
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:12,000
We've only sold 7.

158
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,880
Customers all say they look beautiful.

159
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,200
They just feel

160
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,000
there aren't
enough occasions to wear them,

161
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,480
so they can't see themselves
wearing them often.

162
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,140
And the price is a little high.

163
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,740
That's to be expected.

164
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,920
We're creating a new category.

165
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:24,800
People are hesitant to try something new.

166
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,120
We don't have a name for ourselves yet.
That's normal.

167
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,200
So what should we do?

168
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,680
Should we lower the price

169
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,080
or run some promotions?

170
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,200
Absolutely not.

171
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,400
If we lower the price,

172
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,200
we'll only hurt our positioning.

173
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:37,660
It'll be much harder
to move upmarket later.

174
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,440
Raise the price by 10%.

175
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,520
What we need to do

176
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,680
is build our reputation

177
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:45,140
and let people know
we make quality products

178
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:46,940
that are worth buying.

179
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,500
I have a great idea.

180
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,920
It opens in Yangcheng next month.

181
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:00,440
There will be
plenty of foreign buyers there.

182
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,960
Let's take the qipaos with us

183
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,960
and make a name for ourselves there.

184
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:08,200
That'll be much faster than slowly
building a market here in Shencheng.

185
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,200
Zhi,

186
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,240
spread the word.

187
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,280
Stop all retail sales.

188
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,200
Save the qipaos
for display at the Kanton Fair.

189
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,320
Also, from all the styles
currently on the market,

190
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,720
carefully select 5

191
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,100
and make new patterns for them.

192
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:25,430
Use the finest fabrics.

193
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:27,880
We're going to make them our showstoppers.

194
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:28,520
Yes.
